<title>FRANCE: Renault Credit to issue 1-1.5 bln Ffr 12-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Renault Credit to issue 1-1.5 bln Ffr 12-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Renault Credit International plans to issue a 1-1.5 billion franc 12-year domestic bond imminently, lead manager Societe Generale said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;It's coming out very soon,&quot; a member of the syndicate team at Societe Generale told Reuters.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542</p>
</text>
